  "description": "Uniconta API is a complete API to interact with the Uniconta ERP Server. Uniconta API is the only way to interact with the ERP server. There do not exist any other type of connection or interface. We uses the Uniconta API for all our work on Uniconta our self. \nTo use the Uniconta API you will need your own Uniconta APP identifier.\nhttp://www.uniconta.com/en/developers/",
